  "body": "Leisurebuilt Holiday Cabin and Awning – Orewa Beach Holiday Park\r\n\r\nThis well-presented Leisurebuilt cabin is currently situated at Site D14 within Orewa Beach Holiday Park, a short stroll from beautiful Orewa Beach and close to Red Beach and Hatfields Beach.\r\n\r\nThe spacious covered awning and porch create an additional living area. Zip-opening side panels provide excellent ventilation during warmer weather while also offering shelter and comfort during cooler months.\r\n\r\n* Leisurebuilt cabin with secure lockable access\r\n* Large covered awning and enclosed porch living area\r\n* Three ranch sliders with insect screens\r\n* Thermal drapes and sheers\r\n* Electric oven with two-element cooktop\r\n* Adjustable wall-mounted television arm and aerial\r\n* Clean carpet throughout, with lino in the kitchen area\r\n* Porta-potty for convenient night-time use\r\n* Over-roof less than seven years old and inspected as being in good condition\r\n* Additional clear awning walls to maximise usable covered living space\r\n* New decking floor in the entry foyer for easy level access\r\n* Kitchen wastewater collected for disposal at the holiday park’s designated grey-water facility\r\n\r\nFurnishings - negotiable:\r\n* Corner lounge suite and kitchen-bench bar stools (negotiable)\r\n* As-new sofa bed\r\n* Additional king-single bed in the awning\r\n* Two storage cupboards in the awning\r\n* Queen bed with quality mattress topper and dual-control electric blanket\r\n* Tall storage cupboard in the bedroom area\r\n* Tall bedside lamp and towel rail\r\n* As-new full-sized fridge/freezer with integrated water dispenser\r\n* As-new flatbed microwave\r\n* Seven-fin oil heater\r\n* Outdoor dining table and chairs\r\n\r\nAbout Orewa Beach Holiday Park\r\n\r\nOrewa Beach Holiday Park is managed by Auckland Council and provides a popular beachside holiday environment with facilities including:\r\n\r\n* Camp kitchens\r\n* Shared bathrooms and amenities\r\n* Laundry facilities\r\n* WiFi\r\n* Games room\r\n* Boat-ramp access\r\n\r\nImportant ownership and site information\r\n\r\nThis is a private sale of the privately owned cabin, awning, decking, chattels and associated assets only.\r\n\r\nThe sale does not include:\r\n\r\n* ownership of Site D14\r\n* automatic transfer of the current annual-site concession\r\n* any guaranteed right to occupy Site D14\r\n* any automatic right of renewal\r\n* any waiting-list priority or ongoing interest in the site\r\n\r\nThe cabin and associated assets are offered for sale on the basis that they are to be removed from Orewa Beach Holiday Park at the purchaser’s cost unless an alternative arrangement is made with park management. \r\n\r\nAn in-situ sale may only be possible at the specific approval of park management. \r\n\r\nAny continued occupation of Site D14 is entirely at the discretion of Orewa Beach Holiday Park management and Auckland Council. The seller cannot offer or guarantee the site or concession as part of this sale.\r\n\r\nThe current annual site fee for this site is $6,546, subject to future Auckland Council changes. This information is provided for general guidance only and does not mean that the purchaser will be offered this site or this fee arrangement.\r\n\r\nThe cabin is currently positioned one row back from the beachfront.\r\n\r\nThis is holiday accommodation only and cannot be used as a permanent residence. Any future occupation of an annual site is subject to the applicable Conditions of Occupancy, holiday-park rules, approved occupancy periods and management requirements.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a holiday cabin for relocation or are an eligible waiting-list applicant interested in the complete setup, this is an opportunity to purchase a well-equipped and comfortable Leisurebuilt cabin near one of Auckland’s most popular beaches.",
